# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate from NoiseLearner to NoiseLearnerV3 {#migrate-from-noiselearner-to-noiselearnerv3}"
msgstr "Migrar de NoiseLearner a NoiseLearnerV3 {#migrate-from-noiselearner-to-noiselearnerv3}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide walks you through migrating from IBM Quantum&reg; `NoiseLearner` to `NoiseLearnerV3`. Both\n"
"classes perform experiments that characterize noise processes based on a\n"
"[Pauli-Lindblad noise model](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866), but the inputs and\n"
"outputs are slightly different.\n"
msgstr ""
"Esta guía te muestra cómo migrar de IBM Quantum&reg; `NoiseLearner` a `NoiseLearnerV3`. Ambas\n"
"clases realizan experimentos que caracterizan los procesos de ruido basados en un\n"
"[modelo de ruido de Pauli-Lindblad](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866), pero las entradas y\n"
"salidas son ligeramente diferentes.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Contexto {#background}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [`NoiseLearner`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-noise-learner)\n"
"class was created to allow users to perform explicit noise learning. The resulting\n"
"noise model can then be passed to IBM Quantum `Estimator` for applying error mitigation techniques\n"
"such as PEA and PEC.\n"
msgstr ""
"La clase [`NoiseLearner`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-noise-learner)\n"
"se creó para permitir a los usuarios realizar aprendizaje de ruido explícito. El modelo de ruido\n"
"resultante se puede pasar luego a `Estimator` de IBM Quantum para aplicar técnicas de mitigación de errores\n"
"como PEA y PEC.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`NoiseLearner` was designed to work with `Estimator`, and therefore it implicitly employs the same\n"
"layer finding strategy as `Estimator`. This strategy cannot be changed; otherwise, the subsequent\n"
"mitigation steps would not work correctly.\n"
msgstr ""
"`NoiseLearner` fue diseñado para funcionar con `Estimator`, y por lo tanto emplea implícitamente la misma\n"
"estrategia de búsqueda de capas que `Estimator`. Esta estrategia no se puede cambiar; de lo contrario, los pasos de\n"
"mitigación posteriores no funcionarían correctamente.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Starting with `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.47.0, there is a new\n"
"[`NoiseLearnerV3`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-v3-noise-learner-v3)\n"
"class that is compatible with the `Executor` primitive and the\n"
"[directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model).\n"
"This new model delivers a **white-box** experience by providing the pieces to capture design intent\n"
"on the client side, and a single server-side primitive (Executor) processes those inputs exactly as\n"
"directed — it makes no implicit decisions on your behalf. Unlike the original `NoiseLearner`,\n"
"you control how to stratify your circuits when you use`NoiseLearnerV3`, and the class simply takes a list of boxed circuit instructions\n"
"(for example, unique layers) as its input.\n"
msgstr ""
"A partir de `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.47.0, existe una nueva\n"
"clase [`NoiseLearnerV3`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-v3-noise-learner-v3)\n"
"que es compatible con la primitiva `Executor` y el\n"
"[modelo de ejecución dirigida](/guides/directed-execution-model).\n"
"Este nuevo modelo ofrece una experiencia de **caja blanca** al proporcionar las piezas para capturar la intención de diseño\n"
"en el lado del cliente, y una única primitiva del lado del servidor (Executor) procesa esas entradas exactamente como\n"
"se indica — no toma decisiones implícitas en tu nombre. A diferencia del `NoiseLearner` original,\n"
"tú controlas cómo estratificar tus circuitos cuando usas `NoiseLearnerV3`, y la clase simplemente toma como entrada una lista de instrucciones de circuito en cajas\n"
"(por ejemplo, capas distintas).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`NoiseLearnerV3` also supports measurement noise learning. For each instruction in the input list, it runs the\n"
"Pauli-Lindblad learning protocol if the box contains one- and two-qubit gates, and the\n"
"[TREX](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#twirled-readout-error-extinction-trex)\n"
"protocol if the box contains measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"`NoiseLearnerV3` también admite el aprendizaje de ruido de medición. Para cada instrucción en la lista de entrada, ejecuta el\n"
"protocolo de aprendizaje de Pauli-Lindblad si la caja contiene gates de uno y dos qubits, y el\n"
"protocolo [TREX](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#twirled-readout-error-extinction-trex)\n"
"si la caja contiene mediciones.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Should you migrate? {#should-you-migrate}"
msgstr "¿Debes migrar? {#should-you-migrate}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`NoiseLearner` only works with the legacy server-side `Estimator`, and `NoiseLearnerV3` only works with\n"
"`Executor` and the client-side `Estimator`. **You must migrate to `NoiseLearnerV3` if you are using\n"
"`Executor` or client-side `Estimator`**. The legacy server-side `Estimator` is deprecated and replaced by the client-side equivalent in `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0. \n"
msgstr ""
"`NoiseLearner` solo funciona con el `Estimator` heredado del lado del servidor, y `NoiseLearnerV3` solo funciona con\n"
"`Executor` y el `Estimator` del lado del cliente. **Debes migrar a `NoiseLearnerV3` si estás usando\n"
"`Executor` o el `Estimator` del lado del cliente**. El `Estimator` heredado del lado del servidor está obsoleto y se reemplaza por el equivalente del lado del cliente en `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0. \n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"If you are using `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0 or later, read the [Migrate from server-side to client-side Sampler and Estimator](/guides/migrate-to-client-side-primitives) guide to migrate to client-side primitives first.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Si estás usando `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0 o posterior, lee primero la guía [Migrar de Sampler y Estimator del lado del servidor a los del lado del cliente](/guides/migrate-to-client-side-primitives) para migrar a las primitivas del lado del cliente.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

