# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "(`learner_result` is the output of the learner job)\n"
msgstr "(`learner_result` es la salida del job del learner)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Attribute | NoiseLearner | NoiseLearnerV3 |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Result type | [NoiseLearnerResult](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-noise-learner-result#noiselearnerresult) | [NoiseLearnerV3Results](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-noise-learner-v3-results), a sequence-like container of [NoiseLearnerV3Result](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-noise-learner-v3-result) |\n"
"| Number of learned layers | len(learner_result.data) | len(learner_result) |\n"
"| Data for the first layer | layer_error = learner_result.data[0] | noise_map = learner_result[0].to_pauli_lindblad_map() |\n"
"| Result type of each layer | [`LayerError`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-layer-error) (`type(layer_error)`) | [`PauliLindbladMap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliLindbladMap) (`type(noise_map)`) |\n"
"| Generators for the error channel | `layer_error.error.generators` | `noise_map.generators()` |\n"
"| Error rates | `layer_error.error.rates` | `noise_map.rates` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Atributo | NoiseLearner | NoiseLearnerV3 |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Tipo de resultado | [NoiseLearnerResult](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-noise-learner-result#noiselearnerresult) | [NoiseLearnerV3Results](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-noise-learner-v3-results), un contenedor similar a una secuencia de [NoiseLearnerV3Result](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-noise-learner-v3-result) |\n"
"| Número de capas aprendidas | len(learner_result.data) | len(learner_result) |\n"
"| Datos de la primera capa | layer_error = learner_result.data[0] | noise_map = learner_result[0].to_pauli_lindblad_map() |\n"
"| Tipo de resultado de cada capa | [`LayerError`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-layer-error) (`type(layer_error)`) | [`PauliLindbladMap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliLindbladMap) (`type(noise_map)`) |\n"
"| Generadores para el canal de error | `layer_error.error.generators` | `noise_map.generators()` |\n"
"| Tasas de error | `layer_error.error.rates` | `noise_map.rates` |\n"

